Discriminated unions in the shapes the committed schema does not use: a variant
without a discriminator value before the others, a catch-all as the first
variant, variants that are a direct $ref, and a variant that is an object with
no properties (0012-MADR-schema-fidelity-framework.md).
Found by the mutation run of 0011-PLAN-engine-tests.md, step 9. The meta
declares $/cancel_request and the schema its smallest definition, which the
runtime needs.

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "Start": {"type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string", "const": "start"}, "at": {"type": "integer", "format": "int64"}}, "required": ["kind", "at"]},
  "Stop": {"type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string", "const": "stop"}}, "required": ["kind"]},
  "Event": {"oneOf": [
    {"title": "none", "type": "object"},
    {"$ref": "#/$defs/Start"},
    {"$ref": "#/$defs/Stop"},
    {"title": "other", "type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["kind"], "not": {"anyOf": [{"type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string", "const": "start"}}, "required": ["kind"]}, {"type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string", "const": "stop"}}, "required": ["kind"]}]}}
  ], "discriminator": {"propertyName": "kind"}},
  "Mark": {"anyOf": [
    {"title": "other", "type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["kind"], "not": {"anyOf": [{"type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string", "const": "a"}}, "required": ["kind"]}]}},
    {"type": "object", "properties": {"kind": {"type": "string", "const": "a"}}, "required": ["kind"]}
  ]},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
